==German==

===Etymology===
From {{af|de|sauer|Stoff}}, {{calque|de|fr|oxygène|nocap=1}}, from {{noncog|grc|ὀξύς||sharp}} + {{m|grc|γένος||birth}}, due to a mistaken early belief that oxygen was a necessary ingredient in all acids.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ˈzaʊ̯ɐʃtɔf/}}
* {{audio|de|De-at-Sauerstoff.ogg|a=Austria}}
* {{audio|de|De-Sauerstoff.ogg}}

